  "remarks": "JSC “BCS Bank” is a Russian financial institution headquartered in Moscow. It is a core subsidiary of BCS Financial Group, a major Russian financial conglomerate. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC “BCS Bank” is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
